  MITOSIS-ENGINE  = "30 tapes — H_931, H_942, H_1153, H_1158-H_1181 (incl H_1159b; +Lane-1 H_1179/1180/1181) + clm-time-encoding + lane-m-eeg-mitosis. The criticality / inference-mitosis-learning / super-additivity / life-evolution cluster."
